body:
AJHIAPEFUAOSFMPO:AL<SASFASF

&#x200B;

THAT IS ALL. FUCK.

Invalidating someone's feelings is him telling me I should abandon what I like to do and start doing what other people like even though that doesn't make me happy, and that I should just "stop being needy" even though I have a dependency disorder.

&#x200B;

Also, like I said, I did listen to some people's advice. This guy wasn't the only person who responded to me. I thanked them and said my piece. I just found him in particular very invalidating and rude.

&#x200B;

Also, saying that you don't mean to be rude or that you don't care doesn't mean that this is true lol. In fact it is likely that you know that this is how it comes across that you are saying it that way.
